message: "If you use Artibot in your research or product, please cite it as below."
title: "Artibot: Claude Code Plugin for Multi-Agent Orchestration"
abstract: >-
  Artibot is a Claude Code plugin providing multi-agent orchestration with
  parallel team execution, cognitive routing (System 1/2), lifelong learning
  (GRPO self-evaluation), a 37-hook event pipeline, and 119 domain skills.
  It treats the operator as a delegator and offloads execution plus
  cross-checking to specialized teammates.
type: software
